{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/issues/4145","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/issues/4145/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/issues/4145/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/issues/4145/events","html_url":"https://github.com/etcd-io/etcd/issues/4145","id":125169088,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxMjUxNjkwODg=","number":4145,"title":"etcdctl updatedir requires value","user":{"login":"hypergig","id":8643560,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NDM1NjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8643560?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hypergig","html_url":"https://github.com/hypergig","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hypergig/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hypergig/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hypergig/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hypergig/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hypergig/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hypergig/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hypergig/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hypergig/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hypergig/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":46697272,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0NjY5NzI3Mg==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/labels/type/bug","name":"type/bug","color":"d61552","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":{"login":"gyuho","id":6799218,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3OTkyMTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6799218?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho","html_url":"https://github.com/gyuho","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"gyuho","id":6799218,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3OTkyMTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6799218?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho","html_url":"https://github.com/gyuho","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2016-01-06T12:34:41Z","updated_at":"2016-01-08T02:51:38Z","closed_at":"2016-01-07T00:44:06Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"We have upgraded to 2.2.0 and previous processes that use the `updatedir` subcommand with `etcdctl` fail.\n\nAfter further investigation, we have discovered `updatedir` now requires a value to function.  This doesn't make sense to me as directories don't have values.  I believe `ttl` is the only changeable bit of data on a directory and it is accessible via the `--ttl=n` command switch.\n## Repro steps\n\n_does not work_\n\n```\netcdctl setdir --ttl=60 /foo\netcdctl updatedir --ttl=60 /foo\n```\n\nThe second command will hang, waiting for standard input. If you `^d` the command will successfully complete.\n\n_will work_\n\n```\netcdctl setdir --ttl=60 '/foo'\netcdctl updatedir --ttl=60 '/foo' 'bar'\n```\n\n`bar` isn't used at all.  Infact, if you use the `--debug` switch you see no evidence of `bar` in the provided curl command.\n\n```\netcdctl --debug updatedir --ttl=60 '/foo' 'bar' \nstart to sync cluster using endpoints(http://etcd:2379)\ncURL Command: curl -X GET http://etcd:2379/v2/members\ngot endpoints(http://etcd:2379) after sync\nCluster-Endpoints: http://etcd:2379\ncURL Command: curl -X PUT http://etcd:2379/v2/keys/foo?dir=true&prevExist=true -d \"ttl=60\"\n```\n\nWe even ran tcpdump while executing this command, and again see no evidence of the `bar` value.\n\n```\ntcpdump -A -s 0 'tcp port 2379 and (((ip[2:2] - ((ip[0]&0xf)<<2)) - ((tcp[12]&0xf0)>>2)) != 0)'\n<tcpdump jibber jabber>\n{\"action\":\"update\",\"node\":{\"key\":\"/foo\",\"dir\":true,\"expiration\":\"2016-01-06T12:33:00.474562958Z\",\"ttl\":60,\"modifiedIndex\":2605,\"createdIndex\":2604},\"prevNode\":{\"key\":\"/foo\",\"dir\":true,\"expiration\":\"2016-01-06T12:32:52.592657605Z\",\"ttl\":53,\"modifiedIndex\":2604,\"createdIndex\":2604}}\n```\n\nSo if the value isn't used, why is it required?\n\nI traced it down to this commit ae1669de266c40dc01b6c9747aae72fbd7889ad4 from @xiang90.\n\n```\n    key := c.Args()[0]\n    value, err := argOrStdin(c.Args(), os.Stdin, 1)\n    if err != nil {\n        handleError(ExitBadArgs, errors.New(\"value required\"))\n    }\n```\n\nThanks!\n","closed_by":{"login":"gyuho","id":6799218,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3OTkyMTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6799218?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho","html_url":"https://github.com/gyuho","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gyuho/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/issues/4145/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/etcd-io/etcd/issues/4145/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}